## Types & Shared Code

| Location | Use For |
|----------|---------|
| `@oneohm-epc/shared/types` | Interfaces, enums, state transitions — anything frontend/mobile also needs |
| `@oneohm-epc/shared/utils` | Platform-agnostic helpers (pagination, formatting, validation) |
| `@oneohm-epc/shared/constants` | Shared label maps, config constants |
| `modules/[feature]/types/` | Internal service types, repository-specific types |
| `common/decorators/` | NestJS-specific decorators (ApiCreate, OrganizationContext, etc.) |
| `common/utils/` | toDto, toPaginatedResponse |

**Rule:** If frontend needs it → `@oneohm-epc/shared/types`. Always.
**Rule:** State machine transitions → `@oneohm-epc/shared/types`. Single source of truth for all apps.
**Rule:** NestJS decorators stay in `common/decorators/`, NOT in shared package.

