## Never / Always

| Never | Always |
|-------|--------|
| Skip org filter | `@UseGuards(JwtAuthGuard)` on all endpoints |
| Skip soft delete filter | `@OrganizationContext()` on all endpoints |
| Use `any` type | `deletedAt: IsNull()` in queries |
| Use `console.log` | `this.logger.log()` for logging |
| Return raw entities | `toDto()` for responses |
| Hardcode values | Config/constants |
| Trust client input | Validate everything |
| Duplicate code | Import and extend |
| Trust client `organizationId` | Override from `@OrganizationContext()`: `dto.organizationId = orgId` |
| Manual `parseInt` for pagination | Use `parsePaginationParams()` from `@oneohm-epc/shared/utils` |
| Raw SQL status literals | Use parameterized queries with enum values (`TaskStatus.DONE`) |
| Dev-only bypasses without gate | Guard with `process.env.NODE_ENV === 'development'` |
| Hardcode seed credentials | Use env vars + throw in production if unset |
| Status change via generic update | Dedicated `PATCH :id/status` endpoint with FSM validation |
| Use `this.repository` inside `transaction()` | Use `manager.getRepository(Entity)` for atomicity |

---

## Data Integrity

- **Transactions:** Multi-entity writes MUST use `dataSource.transaction()` with `manager.getRepository()`
- **Date columns:** Compare `DATE` type with `YYYY-MM-DD` string using local date math — never `toISOString()` (timezone shift)
- **Summary vs list:** Aggregate counts (totals, overdue) must be independent queries — never compute from filtered list results
- **Error handling:** Catch specific exceptions and rethrow unexpected ones — don't swallow all errors with generic `BadRequestException`

---

## Checklist (Before Ship)

- [ ] `npx nx affected -t lint` + `typecheck` — zero errors
- [ ] All scenarios + edge cases handled
- [ ] Auth guard + org isolation on all endpoints
- [ ] Multi-entity writes use transactions
- [ ] Error handling — specific exceptions, not generic catch-all
- [ ] No `any`, no `console.log`, no duplication
- [ ] All Never/Always rules above followed

**Unchecked → Fix first → Then ship**
